    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9313" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόστ-ιμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not returning,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖνον ἀ. ἔθηκεν</span>
			<i>cut off</i> his <i>return,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.182
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be retraced,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέλευθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					431
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόστος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>giving a low yield,</i> of corn, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.21.1
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); <i>not nutritious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.91
			</span></i>.</div>
